        "fr_FR": "TransformÃ©e de Fourier bidimensionnelle"
      },
      "description": {
        "en_US": "Reveal the directional frequency content of a synthetic image.",
        "fr_FR": "RÃ©vÃ©ler le contenu frÃ©quentiel directionnel dâ€™une image synthÃ©tique."
      },
